# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Planning data — stays local, the repo is public
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Concept and spec documents are internal working notes and do not belong in a
# public repository. They live in the working directory on purpose so the
# toolchain finds them — but never go into Git.
concepts/
specs/

# Tool configuration of the local working environment — not part of the project.
.claude/

